{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001785","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001785"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001785","label":"智罃（楚所虜晉將）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"智罃","mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0161","c-shiji-039-jin:m103-0058","c-shiji-039-jin:m113-0039"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0161","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p095","quote":"智罃"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m103-0058","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p103","quote":"智罃"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m113-0039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p113","quote":"智罃"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"智罃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001785","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p095","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m103-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"智罃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001785","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p103","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m113-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"智罃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001785","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji039-223","person_id":"cbr-p001785","surfaces":["智罃"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p095","quote":"三年，楚莊王圍鄭，鄭告急晉。晉使荀林父將中軍，隨會將上軍，趙朔將下軍，郤克、欒書、先縠、韓厥、鞏朔佐之。六月，至河。聞楚已服鄭，鄭伯肉袒與盟而去，荀林父欲還。先縠曰：「凡來救鄭，不至不可，將率離心。」卒度河。楚已服鄭，欲飲馬于河爲名而去。楚與晉軍大戰。鄭新附楚，畏之，反助楚攻晉。晉軍敗，走河，爭度，船中人指甚衆。楚虜我將智罃。歸而林父曰：「臣爲督將，軍敗當誅，請死。」景公欲許之。隨會曰：「昔文公之與楚戰城濮，成王歸殺子玉，而文公乃喜。今楚已敗我師，又誅其將，是助楚殺仇也。」乃止。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p103","quote":"十二年冬，齊頃公如晉，欲上尊晉景公爲王，景公讓不敢。晉始作六（卿）［軍］，韓厥、鞏朔、趙穿、荀騅、趙括、趙旃皆爲卿。智罃自楚歸。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p113","quote":"悼公元年正月庚申，欒書、中行偃弒厲公，葬之以一乘車。厲公囚六日死，死十日庚午，智罃迎公子周來，至絳，刑鷄與大夫盟而立之，是爲悼公。辛巳，朝武宮。二月乙酉，卽位。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p095","text":"三年，楚莊王圍鄭，鄭告急晉。晉使荀林父將中軍，隨會將上軍，趙朔將下軍，郤克、欒書、先縠、韓厥、鞏朔佐之。六月，至河。聞楚已服鄭，鄭伯肉袒與盟而去，荀林父欲還。先縠曰：「凡來救鄭，不至不可，將率離心。」卒度河。楚已服鄭，欲飲馬于河爲名而去。楚與晉軍大戰。鄭新附楚，畏之，反助楚攻晉。晉軍敗，走河，爭度，船中人指甚衆。楚虜我將智罃。歸而林父曰：「臣爲督將，軍敗當誅，請死。」景公欲許之。隨會曰：「昔文公之與楚戰城濮，成王歸殺子玉，而文公乃喜。今楚已敗我師，又誅其將，是助楚殺仇也。」乃止。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"覆核更正：原連cbr-p000398楚成王；本提及是同句楚莊王的王，改連cbr-p000257。提及ID、字位及原文不變。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"荀林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001760","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"趙朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001783","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001149","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"欒書","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000415","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"先縠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001765","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001153","status":"conte